    "text": "I\u2019m trading with [VAR 0100(0000)] just now!\\nCan\u2019t wait to see what I get!"
  },
  {
    "index": 153,
    "flags": 4,
    "text": "I started up a Surprise Trade just now.\\nI wonder what kind of Pok\u00E9mon I\u2019ll get?"
  },
  {
    "index": 154,
    "flags": 4,
    "text": "I got a Pok\u00E9mon in a Link Trade just now...\\nand it evolved?! What\u2019re the odds!"
  },
  {
    "index": 155,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "There\u2019[VAR 1101(0000,0201)]sre [VAR 0202(0000)] pe[VAR 1101(0000,0404)]rsonople trading around me right now!\\nPretty amazing, right?"
  },
  {
    "index": 156,
    "flags": 4,
    "text": "I\u2019m in the middle of a Single Battle just now!\\nAnd I\u2019m not planning on losing!"
