    "text": "There\u2019[VAR 1101(0000,0201)]sre [VAR 0202(0000)] pe[VAR 1101(0000,0404)]rsonople battling near where I am!\\nPretty amazing, right?"
  },
  {
    "index": 160,
    "flags": 4,
    "text": "I defeated [VAR 0100(0000)] in a Single Battle!\\nHow d\u2019you like that?"
