  },
  {
    "index": 166,
    "flags": 4,
    "text": "I made a scrummy meal with my Pok\u00E9mon!\\nFancy a curry?"
  },
  {
    "index": 167,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "Come on, everybody! Join me as allies!\\nLet\u2019s start a Max Raid Battle!"
  },
  {
    "index": 168,
