  },
  {
    "index": 310,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "Surprise Trade"
  },
  {
    "index": 311,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "Your system is currently in Airplane Mode,\\nso you can\u2019t connect to other players.\\n\\nTurn off Airplane Mode and try again."
  },
  {
    "index": 312,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "Your software version is out of date, so you\\ncan\u2019t connect to other players.\\n\\nIf you want to communicate with others,\\nyou must update your software.\\nCheck the official website for more details.\\c"
  },
  {
    "index": 313,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "Surprise Trade lets you trade Pok\u00E9mon in a truly\\nsurprising way!\\c\\nSelect a Pok\u00E9mon to trade and leave the rest\\nup to us. As you adventure, we\u2019ll find an eligible\\r\\ntrading partner and carry out the trade for you.\\c\\nSo let\u2019s take care of your only job\u2014choosing a\\nPok\u00E9mon you\u2019re willing to trade!\\c"
  },
  {
    "index": 314,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "Let\u2019s trade some League Cards!\\c\\nYou can also cancel your request by selecting\\nanother option from the menu.\\c"
  },
  {
    "index": 315,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "Would you like to start trading?"
  },
  {
    "index": 316,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "Set Link Code"
  },
  {
    "index": 317,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "Start trading"
  },
  {
    "index": 318,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "You\u2019ve set your Link Code to be:\\n[VAR 0203(0000,0000)] [VAR 0203(0001,0000)].\\c\\nWould you like to trade using this Link Code?"
  },
  {
    "index": 319,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "You haven\u2019t set a Link Code.\\c\\nWithout a Link Code, you might be connected\\nto someone other than the person you meant to\\r\\nplay together with. Would you like to continue?"
  },
  {
    "index": 320,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "Would you like to add [VAR 0100(0000)] to your\\nblock list?"
  },
  {
    "index": 321,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "You won\u2019t be able to connect again with any\\nplayer you add to your block list.\\c\\nAre you sure you want to block this player?\\n(It\u2019s possible to unblock the player again.)"
  },
  {
    "index": 322,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "[VAR 0100(0000)] has been added to your\\nblock list.\\c\\nYou can check your block list from the Profile\\noption in the Y-Comm menu.\\c"
  },
  {
    "index": 323,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "Yes"
  },
  {
    "index": 324,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "No"
  },
  {
    "index": 325,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": " Local Communication"
  },
  {
    "index": 326,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "This player has finished recruiting Trainers\\nto join their Max Raid Battle.\\c\\nLet\u2019s clear out your old stamps, and get you a\\nfresh set of the latest stamps.\\c"
  },
  {
    "index": 327,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "Want to swap League Cards with me?"
  },
  {
    "index": 328,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "[~ 328]"
  },
  {
    "index": 329,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "You can\u2019t swap League Cards right now.\\c"
  },
  {
    "index": 330,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "Looks like your album is full!\\c\\nPlease check your album if you want to start\\nswapping cards.\\c"
  },
  {
    "index": 331,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "Quit"
  },
  {
    "index": 332,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "You\u2019ve already added this person to your\\nblock list.\\c"
  },
  {
    "index": 333,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "You can\u2019t add yourself to your block list!\\c"
  },
  {
    "index": 334,
    "flags": 4,
    "text": "If you and another player set the same Link Code,\\nyou can be sure to connect with one another.\\c"
  },
  {
    "index": 335,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "You can\u2019t perform a Link Trade, because your\\nyour last trade ended without being completed,\\r\\nperhaps due to a connection error or turning off\\r\\nthe power to your system.\\c\\nPlease wait a while, without changing the time\\non your Nintendo Switch system, then try again.\\c"
  },
  {
    "index": 336,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "You have no Pok\u00E9mon in your Boxes, so you\\ncan\u2019t carry out a trade.\\c\\nPlease start a trade after catching some\\nmore Pok\u00E9mon!\\c"
  },
  {
    "index": 337,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "You don\u2019t have more than two Pok\u00E9mon, so you\\ncan\u2019t carry out a trade.\\c\\nPlease start a trade after catching some\\nmore Pok\u00E9mon!\\c"
  },
  {
    "index": 338,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "You can\u2019t take part in a Double Battle unless you\\nhave at least two Pok\u00E9mon that can battle.\\c\\nGet your team together, then try again!\\c"
  },
  {
    "index": 339,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "Communicating...\\nPlease wait a moment."
  },
  {
    "index": 340,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "There is a problem with the Pok\u00E9mon\\nyou\u2019ve selected.\\c"
  },
  {
    "index": 341,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "Communication failed.\\c"
  },
